        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF149 supports <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLInputElement.showPicker()</code> for a <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;datalist&gt;</code> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1998668\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1998668</a> - but according to that link not on Android</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the feature.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3977947331\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43201\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43201/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43201\">mdn/content#43201</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29163",
            "title": "Ff149htmlinputelement showpicker datalist",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-03T03:43:28.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-03T03:42:53.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds features for the request and response headers from the <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-dbsc/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Device Bound Session Credentials</a> (DBSC) spec.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I took the version numbers from the rollout steps in the <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5140168270413824\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chrome Platform Status entry</a>. Vendor <a href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3749\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3749/hovercard\">commentary</a> on this feature in web-features led me to believe this is accurate.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3908431283\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3749\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3749/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3749\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3749</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29161",
            "title": "Add device bound session credentials headers",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-02T17:51:36.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-02T17:48:42.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
                "url": "https://github.com/ddbeck"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mark Chromium's <code class=\"notranslate\">api.Request.formData</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">api.Response.formData</code> as partial</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I used <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/captainbrosset/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/captainbrosset\">@captainbrosset</a>'s test cases in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4011432158\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29156\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29156/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29156\">#29156</a> to confirm. I am presuming that this has always been the case, as the linked bug reports don't seem to indicate some sort of regression.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29156.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4011432158\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29156\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29156/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29156\">#29156</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Others:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3982310947\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3813\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3813/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3813\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3813</a>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"863278534\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/28607\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/28607/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/28607\">web-platform-tests/wpt#28607</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=225238\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=225238</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
