        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2218736?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add the first versions of Node and Deno that support <a href=\"https://github.com/tc39/proposal-duplicate-named-capturing-groups\">duplicate named capturing groups</a> which appears on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Regular_expressions/Named_capturing_group#browser_compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Regular_expressions/Named_capturing_group#browser_compatibility</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">I found the first versions of Node and Deno by explicit testing:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Node: unsupported in 22.x, supported in 23.x\nnpx -y node@22.22.0 -e &quot;try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})-\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(process.version, process.versions.v8);&quot;\nnpx -y node@23.0.0 -e &quot;try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})-\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(process.version, process.versions.v8);&quot;\n# Deno: unsupported in 1.43.6, supported in 1.44.0\nnpx -y deno@1.46.3 upgrade --version 1.43.6 --output deno1436.exe\n./deno1436.exe eval &quot;try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})-\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(Deno.version.deno, Deno.version.v8);&quot;\nrm deno1436.exe\nnpx -y deno@1.46.3 upgrade --version 1.44.0 --output deno1440.exe\n./deno1440.exe eval &quot;try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})-\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;\\\\d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(Deno.version.deno, Deno.version.v8);&quot;\nrm deno1440.exe\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Node: unsupported in 22.x, supported in 23.x</span>\nnpx -y node@22.22.0 -e <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})-<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}|<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(process.version, process.versions.v8);<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\nnpx -y node@23.0.0 -e <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})-<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}|<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(process.version, process.versions.v8);<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Deno: unsupported in 1.43.6, supported in 1.44.0</span>\nnpx -y deno@1.46.3 upgrade --version 1.43.6 --output deno1436.exe\n./deno1436.exe <span class=\"pl-c1\">eval</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})-<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}|<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(Deno.version.deno, Deno.version.v8);<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\nrm deno1436.exe\nnpx -y deno@1.46.3 upgrade --version 1.44.0 --output deno1440.exe\n./deno1440.exe <span class=\"pl-c1\">eval</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>try { new RegExp('(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})-<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}|<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{2}-(?&lt;year&gt;<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\\</span>d{4})'); console.log('supported'); } catch { console.log('unsupported'); } console.log(Deno.version.deno, Deno.version.v8);<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\nrm deno1440.exe</pre></div>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Node introduced the feature in <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/9d7cd9b864cacb72409e693aa26c36338efa05ca/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/9d7cd9b864cacb72409e693aa26c36338efa05ca\">nodejs/node@<tt>9d7cd9b</tt></a> (<code class=\"notranslate\">deps: update V8 to 12.8.374.13</code>) which came from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2433810985\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/54077\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nodejs/node/pull/54077/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/54077\">nodejs/node#54077</a> which explicitly lists “RegExp duplicate named capture groups” as a notable change. The commit is mentioned in <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v23.0.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v23.0.0</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Deno introduced this feature in <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/commit/b009c84bc6f773326d41bbd7f86cec2a5309291a/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/commit/b009c84bc6f773326d41bbd7f86cec2a5309291a\">denoland/deno@<tt>b009c84</tt></a> (<code class=\"notranslate\">feat: enable pointer compression via deno_core bump (#23838)</code>) which came from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2299074801\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/23838\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/denoland/deno/pull/23838/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/pull/23838\">denoland/deno#23838</a> which is mentioned in <a href=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/tag/v1.44.0\">https://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/tag/v1.44.0</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">V8 introduced this feature in V8 12.5.x. Relevant commits:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Implement: <code class=\"notranslate\">[regexp] Implement duplicate named capture groups</code>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Gerrit: <a href=\"https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/5200239\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/5200239</a></li>\n<li>Commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/f1ad38bed6a36d5f8221d38750ad78e2a8203af3/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/f1ad38bed6a36d5f8221d38750ad78e2a8203af3\">v8/v8@<tt>f1ad38b</tt></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Ship: <code class=\"notranslate\">[regexp] Ship duplicate named capture groups</code>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Gerrit: <a href=\"https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/5379754\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/5379754</a></li>\n<li>Commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/3ca1bdef7b6f7a75dc7b9e47cf03ebd37861c212/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/3ca1bdef7b6f7a75dc7b9e47cf03ebd37861c212\">v8/v8@<tt>3ca1bde</tt></a></li>\n<li>Moves <code class=\"notranslate\">js_regexp_duplicate_named_groups</code> into shipping features</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29146",
            "title": "javascript.regular_expressions: duplicate named groups runtime support",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-27T16:33:25.000Z",
